<title>UK: BOE allots 1.85 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.85 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.85 billion stg of assistance to help offset the estimated 2.2 billion stg shortage.</p>
<p>It allotted 374 million stg in bills outright and 1.476 bln stg in repos to June 9.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.25 percent.</p>
</text>
